############################################################################
Additional Information
############################################################################

During installation, this program downloads and installs the readPTU_FLIM.py
component from an external repository (readPTU_FLIM project - the NIKON_correction branch).

The readPTU_FLIM.py file is licensed under the MIT License.
The full MIT License text will be stored within the readPTU_FLIM.py file in the
src/smICA/Required/Third_party directory.

This software also includes the Python Embedded Distribution for Windows,
which is licensed under the Python Software Foundation License (PSF).
License information for Python is provided in the embedded distribution.

This repository also includes a copy of the DejaVu Sans Condensed font (TTF files), 
which are distributed under their own license.
Please refer to the font files or the accompanying LICENSE files
for details on their usage and redistribution terms.

